Parts of this repository are not my own work.

keybinds.kdl and rules1.kdl started as copies of the niri configuration that
CachyOS ships in https://github.com/CachyOS/cachyos-niri-noctalia under
etc/skel/.config/niri/cfg/ (keybinds.kdl and rules.kdl), taken at commit
8938e953. That repository is licensed under the GNU General Public License
version 3, and copyright in the original files stays with the CachyOS authors.

110 of the 113 non-blank lines in keybinds.kdl are byte for byte identical to
upstream, comments and column alignment included; what I changed is the
terminal and browser binds and a handful of noctalia IPC calls. rules1.kdl
keeps 20 of its 35 non-comment lines from upstream rules.kdl verbatim apart
from indentation, including the two Steam window rules with the
`open-focused false` line that CachyOS added and that does not appear in the
niri wiki version of the same snippet.

Because those files are derivative works of GPL-3.0 code, this repository is
distributed under the GPL-3.0. The full licence text is in LICENSE.

The setup targets niri (https://github.com/niri-wm/niri, GPL-3.0) and
noctalia-shell (https://github.com/noctalia-dev/noctalia, MIT). The IPC
commands used in the keybinds are documented by noctalia-shell.

settings.json is a dump of my own noctalia-shell settings, fastfetchnew.jsonc
is my own fastfetch config, and README.md is mine. Neither config file was
copied from another project.
